From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 16:11:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Commit block children's layouts as they are laid out

Every block item held its finished Layout (96 of its 320 bytes on
wasm32) until the whole container was laid out, though only a non-normal
align-content shifts them first. Items now commit their layout at once
and keep only its location for out-of-flow anchors; the layouts are held
in a side list only when align-content will move them. Geometry is
unchanged.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
 src/compute/block.rs | 126 +++++++++++++++++++++++++------------------
 src/tree/cache.rs    |  48 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 52 deletions(-)

